<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Perform in tough conditions" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Perform in tough conditions</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Maintain high operational availability in challenging conditions. Conformal coating on electronic boards provides reliable performance and safeguards your critical infrastructure.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Simplify operation" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Simplify operation</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>The intuitive, user-friendly design helps operators easily handle devices and configure functions for efficient operation. Reduce complexity for device and software management.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Integrate your system" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Integrate your system</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Achieve full compatibility across IEC 61850 Editions 1, 2.0 and 2.1 for integration across your operational environment, even with diverse system architectures.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='1XVXaLoCDp5nKzwdrwlF9I' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='1XVXaLoCDp5nKzwdrwlF9I'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-1XVXaLoCDp5nKzwdrwlF9I" class="Car