bersecurity</h3><div id="G_Cybersecurity-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Extensive cybersecurity functionality, such as role-based access control (RBAC), protocoling security-related events, signed firmware or authenticated network access IEEE 802.1X.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-6"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Graphical logic editor" id="G_Graphical%20logic%20editor-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Graphical%20logic%20editor-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Graphical%20logic%20editor-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Graphical%20logic%20editor-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Graphical logic editor</h3><div id="G_Graphical%20logic%20editor-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Graphical logic editor to create powerful automation functions in the device.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-6"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Protect three-winding transformers" id="G_Protect%20three-winding%20transformers-3" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Protect%20three-winding%20transformers-3-title" aria-describedby="G_Protect%20three-winding%20transformers-3-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Protect%20three-winding%20transformers-3-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Protect three-winding transformers</h3><div id="G_Protect%20three-winding%20transformers-3-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>SIPROTEC 7UT86 offers differential protection for 3-winding (expandable to 4-winding) transformers. Compares currents for rapid internal fault tripping, boosting transformer/power system stability &amp; versatility.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/1XVXaLoCDp5nKzwdrwlF9I-en-US.json" page-id="2lun4ZnzVG1zOLjPwjr4PU" container="comp-1XVXaLoCDp5nKzwdrwlF9I"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='4foKydTtY8j5lpK6RZ11Pj' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_4' data-ste-section-id='4foKydTtY8j5lpK6RZ11Pj'>
